    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Paper Fish is a swing set dressed as an origami fish, with orange fish panels on a blue frame and a Mango Yellow seat. One installation photo shows it on a blue river-pattern safety surface, which completes the theme. The design follows a groove idea, so more than one child can swing together instead of waiting for a turn. It is meant for ages 5 to 12. The product area is 10'9\" x 8'10\" and the safe play area is 15'9\" x 14'10\". Swinging this way works on hand-eye coordination and spatial awareness. Like the rest of the Kagzi range, its galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts and composite laminates carry a 3-year warranty. Call +91 902 830 2266 to discuss your site."
     }
    ]
